      "instance_name": "rebuilt_tranny",
      "label": "rebuilt transmission",
      "description": "A transmission that has been disassembled, repaired, and reassembled, often to restore functionality after wear or damage. May involve replacing worn parts, cleaning, and re-greasing. Often considered a cost-effective alternative to buying a new transmission, but quality can vary depending on the rebuild shop.",
